Third-party components
----------------------

* Window blur kernel
  The window-blur effect reimplements the separable Gaussian blur used by
  GNOME Shell / Mutter (the GLSL in mutter's clutter-blur.c / ClutterBlurNode,
  distributed under the GNU Lesser General Public License v2.1-or-later).
  The shader math is reproduced for behavioral compatibility with the shell's
  native blur.

* Ecosystem
  Plaid builds on the GNOME Shell and GNOME Shell extensions ecosystem. Thanks
  to the GNOME developers and the extensions community whose work and
  documentation make projects like this possible.
